+# Aegis — Production Enablement Orchestration
+
+This collection automates and orchestrates the final gate closure steps to move Aegis from SHADOW → narrowly scoped AUTO:
+
+Key scripts:
+- ops/run_hsm_vault_commission.sh : Provision CloudHSM (terraform), upgrade Vault with PKCS#11 values, and guide dual-control activation.
+- ops/validate_vault_signing_and_evidence.sh : Validate Vault transit signing and optionally register a signature to Rekor.
+- rekor/restore/run_drill_and_report.sh : Run Rekor restore drill, validate, and produce an RTO report JSON.
+- legal/dpa/register_and_validate_vendors.sh : Register vendors in DPA registry and validate compliance before use.
+- security/pentest/execute_import_and_remediate.sh : Import pentest results, block AUTO when critical/high found, and run remediation tracker.
+- ci/workflows/run_shadow_and_upload.yml : GitHub Actions workflow to run 10k enhanced shadow proposals and upload summary.
+- scale/run_ray_katib_karpenter_experiment.sh : Execute Ray/Katib load + Karpenter provisioning measurement.
+- observability/otel/wire_and_validate_trace_evidence.sh : Help wire OTEL instrumentation and run e2e trace evidence validation.
+- governance/convene_and_enable_auto.sh : Governance checklist and gated AUTO enablement using dual_control (PGP verification + registry checks).
+
+Important operational notes:
+- These scripts assume appropriate kubeconfig / cloud credentials and operator presence. They do not embed secrets; use your secret management (Vault/CI secrets) for production values.
+- Follow the Production Activation Checklist (runbooks/production_activation_checklist.md) and obtain Governance Board sign-off before enabling AUTO.
+- All artifacts produced by these scripts (signatures, RTO reports, shadow-run summaries, pentest tickets) must be archived in MCP evidence and your ticketing system.
+
